# CAP mobile app configuration (Expo).
#
# Copy to `.env` (or set these in your shell/CI) to point the app at a real
# backend. Values here are PUBLIC transport config — never put secrets, tokens,
# or PHI in an `EXPO_PUBLIC_*` variable; Expo inlines these into the JS bundle.
#
# Leave unset to keep the safe prototype defaults: mock submission and
# UI-only local document handling (nothing is persisted or sent anywhere).
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_CAP_SUBMISSION_MODE=mock   # or `api` to POST /intakes
# EXPO_PUBLIC_CAP_UPLOAD_MODE=local      # or `presigned` for two-step upload
# EXPO_PUBLIC_CAP_API_BASE_URL=          # e.g. https://cap-api.example.com
